0 BEGIN PGM TL03 MM
1 ; WRITTEN FOR GEDIT - SYNTHETIC TEST PROGRAM, NOT FOR A MACHINE
2 * - ONE TOOL, TWO SPEEDS
3 TOOL CALL 4 Z S3000 F500
4 L Z+100 R0 FMAX M3
5 L Z-1 R0 F200
6 ; SPEED CHANGE ONLY, SAME TOOL
7 TOOL CALL Z S5000
8 L Y+20
9 TOOL CALL S6000 F900
10 L Z+100 R0 FMAX M9
11 M30
12 END PGM TL03 MM
